{"id":"n1-207","title":"～とみえて (〜to miete)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"It seems that; apparently","longExplanation":"The ～とみえて grammar point is used to express the speaker's judgment about a situation based on visible or known information. It is often translated as 'apparently' or 'it seems that' in English.","formation":"Verb-casual + とみえて, い-Adjective + とみえて, な-Adjective + だとみえて, Noun + だとみえて","examples":[{"jp":"彼は運動が得意とみえて、毎日ジムに行っています。","romaji":"Kare wa undou ga tokui to miete, mainichi jimu ni itteimasu.","en":"He seems to be good at exercise, as he goes to the gym every day.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"運動","vocabId":"1172910","reading":"うんどう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"得意","vocabId":"1454510","reading":"とくい"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みえ","vocabId":"1578350","reading":"みえ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"毎日","vocabId":"1524720","reading":"まいにち"},{"surface":"ジム","vocabId":"1314270","reading":"じむ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行っ","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼女は忙しいとみえて、なかなか会えない。","romaji":"Kanojo wa isogashii to miete, nakanaka aenai.","en":"She seems to be busy, as it's hard to meet her.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"忙しい","vocabId":"1519290","reading":"いそがしい"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みえ","vocabId":"1578350","reading":"みえ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なかなか","vocabId":"1599420","reading":"なかなか"},{"surface":"会え","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"田中さんは疲れているとみえて、早く帰りました。","romaji":"Tanaka-san wa tsukarete iru to miete, hayaku kaerimashita.","en":"It seems that Tanaka-san was tired, as he went home early.","words":[{"surface":"田中","vocabId":null},{"surface":"さん","vocabId":"1579350","reading":"さん"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"疲れ","vocabId":"1483730","reading":"つかれ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みえ","vocabId":"1578350","reading":"みえ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"早く","vocabId":"1400150","reading":"はやく"},{"surface":"帰り","vocabId":"1221250","reading":"かえり"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"その店は人気だとみえて、いつも行列ができている。","romaji":"Sono mise wa ninki da to miete, itsumo retsu ga dekite iru.","en":"That shop seems to be popular, as there is always a line.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"店","vocabId":"1582120","reading":"みせ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"人気","vocabId":"1367010","reading":"にんき"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みえ","vocabId":"1578350","reading":"みえ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いつも","vocabId":"1188890","reading":"いつも"},{"surface":"行列","vocabId":"1282220","reading":"ぎょうれつ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でき","vocabId":"1340430","reading":"でき"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]}]}